00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:03.210
- I see y'all over there.

00:00:03.210 --> 00:00:04.950
Alright, that was really good.

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:06.000
Alright, alright.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.390
I always try to close the show
